  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/IMG_7739.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>230 fotos de los 4 d&iacute;as de fiestas en el barrio del Tossalet, en Onda, desde las vaquillas de Ram&oacute;n Benet del jueves a la procesi&oacute;n de San Bartolom&eacute; del domingo, passando por las vacas de Garc&iacute;a Gam&oacute;n y la disco m&oacute;vil de la pe&ntilde;a Macho Ib&eacute;rico y del toro de Palha de la Asociaci&oacute;n Taurina, el s&aacute;bado.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festestossalet15/img_6872.jpg\" alt=\"img_6872\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festestossalet15/img_6873.jpg\" alt=\"img_6873\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festestossalet15/img_6877.jpg\" alt=\"img_6877\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festestossalet15/img_6879.jpg\" alt=\"img_6879\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festestossalet15/img_6880.jpg\" alt=\"img_6880\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festestossalet15/img_6881.jpg\" alt=\"img_6881\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festestossalet15/img_6882.jpg\" alt=\"img_6882\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festestossalet15/img_7125.jpg\" alt=\"img_7125\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festestossalet15/img_7126.jpg\" alt=\"img_7126\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />